      {
        "tag_name": "v1.3.4",
        "name": "Neverwin 1.3.4",
        "body": "The native Air Strafe can now strafe toward a direction set from Lua (via movement.airstrafe_directional and movement.airstrafe_boost), at full native speed, without turning the camera or pressing movement keys, and works with Silent Throw.\nWhen no direction is set, Air Strafe works as before; movement.airstrafe tells scripts that the loaded DLL has this patch.",
